\subsubsection*{Repair cards}

A repair card is the printed form of one \code{RepairRecord}: the rung, the
four altered sets, the message counts and the budgets on the left, and the
routes of the affected robots before and after on the right.  The four cards
of the shift are reproduced below; they are also the compact unit in which
the whole method can be audited, because every claim of a row in
Table~\ref{tab:passesA} is visible on the corresponding card.

\begin{figure}[H]
\centering
\includegraphics[width=0.99\textwidth]{caseA_repair_card_00.png}\par\vspace{4pt}
